########### gff+bitacora 注释物种OR序列 #############

1. OR database 构建 
下载PF02949，鳞翅目物种的OR序列，删除ORco序列
结合三款软件预测跨膜次数，使用脚本进行过滤
获取LeiOR_db.fasta LeiOR_db.hmm

####2. 基于gff + hmmer 的搜索   ####废除
####./FilterOR.sh ${sp_name} ${genome} ${gff}
####${gff} : 保留最长转录本的gff

3. 基于bitacora 搜索
sh ./runBITACORA.sh ${sp_name} ${genome} ${gff} ${pep.fasta} ${7tm_db}
[针对nr.fasta运行三款tm软件得到stat,并改名为sp_name.stat]
######4. 过滤、整合两种方法结果。废除
#####sh ./GetCombaineORseq.sh ${7tm_db}.genomic_and_annotated_proteins_trimmed_nr.fasta ${sp_name}_OR_Filter_Intermediate/${sp_name}.OR.Filter.stat ${sp_name}
#####结果为： ${sp_name}.combainOR.pep.fa

4. 过滤bitacora结果
python3 GetOR0507.py ${sp_name}.stat LeiOR_genomic_and_annotated_genes_nr.gff3 ${genome} ${sp_name}
结果为final.id 及 final.pep.fa

5. 基于nr库筛选or id
blastp -query ${sp_name}.combainOR.pep.fa -db /database/nr/20250215/nr  -evalue 1e-5 -out ${sp_name}.combainOR.pep.fa.blast.output -max_target_seqs 5 -num_threads 16 -outfmt 6
zcat /database/nr/20250215/nr.fasta.gz | grep "^>" > nr.seq.id
python3 PraseSeqName.py ${sp_name}.combainOR.pep.fa.blast.output nr.seq.id [基于文件大小，拆分20000000行/文件]
#合并 cat tmp/${sp_name}* | sort -k 1,1 > ${sp_name}.blast.id
python3 SelectOR.py ${sp_name}.blast.id
结果为：${sp_name}.notor.id  ${sp_name}.or.id 
